 "notes": "Kinds kept: all 7 old kinds plus 2 new (Ear bonnet, Travel boots and bandages). Exercise sheet, quarter sheet and anti-sweat sheet are types of Cooler rug; rain sheet a type of Turnout rug. Archetypes: Rambo turnout, Amigo turnout, Rambo fly rug, Amigo fly rug (Horseware; years only where sourced: Rambo 1985). Left out: SKU tails (Shires Typhoon colours, Weatherbeeta mask variants, most LeMieux overreach variants, Schneiders duplicates, Millbry Hill/Masta/DefenceX/Thermo Master/Dominick coolers, generic 'Brushing boot'/'Open-front boot' entries turned into types). eskadron in brand register only: model pages (Horze) blocked 403, so no eskadron models named. Old 'ARMA Over Reach Bell Boots' credited to Shires (ARMA is a Shires line per gsequestrian page). No traditions apply."
